songs.text:
{title: Increíble}
{artist: Miel San Marcos}
{key: F}
{tempo: 130}

{comment: Intro (x2)}
[F] [C] [G] [Am]

{comment: Estrofa}
[F]Poderoso, [C]invencible,
[G]admirable, [Am]grande y fuerte,
[F]Rey de Reyes, [C]asombroso,
[G]incomparable... [Am]

{comment: Coro}
[F]Eres in[C]creíble,
[G]todopoderoso, [Am]grande [C/E]
[F]Eres in[C]creíble,
[G]venciste las [Am]tinieblas,
[F]Cristo exal[C]tado es[G]tás

{comment: Puente}
[F]Increíble, in[C]vencible,
[G]Dios solo Tú, [Am]solo Tú, [Em]
